cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: ANTs registration to MNI152
abstract: Registers each T1-weighted image to the MNI152NLin2009cAsym template with ANTs and carries an
  optional label map into template space. Writes the warped images, the transforms and a per-subject registration
  check.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-ants-mni
license: Apache-2.0
